{
    "_comment": "Gus - candy maker in Sugarwood Grove, at the gingerbread hut. A tired salesman: every visit is a new short talk (counter 'gus_talks') and the sales smile gets more forced. On the 5th visit (13.11; was 10th - and from the 2nd visit on he hints that coming back pays off) he loses his patience and gives the quest 'gus': bring a Sugar Crystal (5% drop from sugar casters, only while the quest is active) -> Glue Gun. Sells nothing yet (shop UI later).",
    "partner": "gus",
    "start": [
        {
            "if": {
                "quest_done": "gus"
            },
            "goto": "after"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "quest": "gus",
                "item": "Sugar Crystal"
            },
            "goto": "hand_in"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "quest": "gus"
            },
            "goto": "waiting"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "flag": "gus:snapped"
            },
            "goto": "snap_again"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "counter_at_least": [
                    "gus_talks",
                    4
                ]
            },
            "goto": "snap"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "counter_at_least": [
                    "gus_talks",
                    3
                ]
            },
            "goto": "visit4"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "counter_at_least": [
                    "gus_talks",
                    2
                ]
            },
            "goto": "visit3"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "counter_at_least": [
                    "gus_talks",
                    1
                ]
            },
            "goto": "visit2"
        },
        "visit1"
    ],
    "nodes": {
        "visit1": {
            "do": {
                "count": "gus_talks"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gus_01",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "Welcome, welcome, my friend! Welcome to Gus's Sweets, the finest candy in all of Sugarwood!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_02",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Gumdrops, toffee, sugar glass... hand-made, every single one. The smile comes free of charge."
                },
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "What do you have?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_03",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "Today? Ah. Today the shelves are... resting. Fresh batch tomorrow! Come back tomorrow, my friend."
                }
            ]
        },
        "visit2": {
            "do": {
                "count": "gus_talks"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gus_04",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "My friend! You came back! A customer who comes back - that's the best kind of customer."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_05",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "The batch? Ah. Not ready. Sugar's a moody thing. You can't rush sugar."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_54",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "Keep coming back, my friend. Good things happen to customers who keep coming back. That's a rule. I think."
                }
            ]
        },
        "visit3": {
            "do": {
                "count": "gus_talks"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gus_12",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "Welcome to Gus's... you know what this is."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_13",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "Do you ever buy anything, friend? Anywhere? Or do you just walk around and talk to people?"
                },
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Mostly the second one."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_14",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "Mhm. Great. Wonderful business model."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_55",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "Come back again anyway. Maybe something will change. Maybe it'll be me."
                }
            ]
        },
        "visit4": {
            "do": {
                "count": "gus_talks"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gus_19",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "I'll be honest with you, friend. There's no batch. There was never going to be a batch tomorrow."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_20",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "I just like saying 'tomorrow'. It sounds good. Sounds like business."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_22",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "You know how many customers I had this year? One. You. And you don't buy."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_23",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "angry",
                    "text": "I'm not angry. I'm a salesman. Salesmen don't get angry. We get... motivated."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_56",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "One more visit, friend. Just one more. Let's see what happens."
                }
            ]
        },
        "snap": {
            "do": {
                "count": "gus_talks",
                "flag": "gus:snapped"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gus_26",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "angry",
                    "text": "Okay. That's it. Smile's off. Shop's closed."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_27",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "angry",
                    "text": "Five times. Five times you came here, and not one gumdrop. Do you know what that does to a man?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_28",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "No more 'my friend'. You want to stand at my counter? Then you're going to be useful."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_29",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "pointing",
                    "text": "The sugar casters out in the grove - those little show-offs throwing sugar bombs around. Sometimes one of them carries a Sugar Crystal."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_30",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "Pure stuff. The real thing. With one of those I could make an actual batch. A real one. Not a 'tomorrow' one."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_31",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Bring me one, and I'll give you something better than candy. Deal?"
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "Deal.",
                    "goto": "accept"
                },
                {
                    "text": "I'm just looking.",
                    "goto": "just_looking"
                }
            ]
        },
        "snap_again": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gus_32",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Changed your mind? Sugar Crystal. Sugar casters. Something better than candy."
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "Deal.",
                    "goto": "accept"
                },
                {
                    "text": "I'm just looking.",
                    "goto": "just_looking"
                }
            ]
        },
        "accept": {
            "do": {
                "quest": {
                    "start": "gus"
                }
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gus_33",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Good. Finally. A transaction."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_34",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "pointing",
                    "text": "They're quick and they don't like being caught. Don't come back with excuses. Come back with a crystal."
                }
            ]
        },
        "just_looking": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gus_35",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "...Of course you are."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_36",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "The offer stands. The shop doesn't."
                }
            ]
        },
        "waiting": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gus_37",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "No crystal? Then no chatting. Time is money. Mostly money I don't have."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_38",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "Sugar casters. Grove. Crystal. Do I need to draw you a picture?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_39",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "They run away when you get close? Yeah. So do customers."
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "Any tips?",
                    "goto": "tips"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Bye.",
                    "goto": "end"
                }
            ]
        },
        "tips": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gus_40",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "pointing",
                    "text": "They throw from far away and hate it when you're close. So get close. Stay close."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_41",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "And don't stand in the white stuff. Trust me."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_42",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "Oh, and not every one of them has a crystal. Most don't. That's what makes it pure."
                }
            ]
        },
        "hand_in": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gus_43",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "surprised",
                    "text": "Is that... hold on. Let me see that."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_44",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "surprised",
                    "text": "That's a Sugar Crystal. A real one. Look at it shine."
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "Here you go.",
                    "goto": "give"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Not yet.",
                    "goto": "not_yet"
                }
            ]
        },
        "not_yet": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gus_45",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "...You're killing me, friend. Killing me."
                }
            ]
        },
        "give": {
            "do": {
                "take": "Sugar Crystal",
                "give": "Glue Gun",
                "quest": {
                    "finish": "gus"
                }
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gus_46",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "happy",
                    "text": "Hah! Ha! A real batch. A real one!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_47",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "pointing",
                    "text": "Here. Take this. I used it to seal candy boxes, back when I had boxes to seal."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_48",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "Sticks to anything. Monsters included. Don't point it at the shelves."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_49",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "happy",
                    "text": "...Thanks. I mean it. That one wasn't a sales smile."
                }
            ]
        },
        "after": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gus_50",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "happy",
                    "text": "The batch is coming along. A real tomorrow, this time."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_51",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "You're still not buying anything, are you? That's fine. You're a different kind of customer."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_52",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "Ever notice the others never stop smiling? Mine stops. I think that's a good thing."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gus_53",
                    "who": "gus",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "Business is terrible. But the candy is real. One out of two, that's not bad."
                }
            ]
        }
    }
}
